authentic fossilized shark tooth + australian opal doublet. my original design made from wax. tiny chip on top of shark tooth.

*this statement ring includes a real shark tooth fossil as well as a doublet Opal – both very fragile. It is not recommended to wear this ring whilst doing any kind of physical labour / exercise where it could be at risk of getting damaged
